

**25.2.1**: \(f(x)\!=\!\sum\limits_{i=0}^{n}l_{i}(x)f_{i}\!+\!R_{n}(x)\)

\(l_{i}(x)\!=\!\frac{\pi_{n}(x)}{(x\!-\!x_{i})\pi_{n}^{*}(x_{i})}\)

\(=\!\frac{(x\!-\!x_{0})\ \ldots\ (x\!-\!x_{i-1})(x\!-\!x_{i+1})\ \ldots\ (x\!-\!x_{n})}{(x_{i}\!-\!x_{0})\ \ldots\ (x_{i}\!-\!x_{i-1})(x_{i}\!-\!x_{i+1})\ \ldots\ (x_{i}\!-\!x_{n})}\)

